<</AP<</N 11875 0 R >>/Border[ 0 0 0]/Contents(Influencing the Factors that Create Changes:\n\nWhat it means: Try to make sure that any changes to the project are good and helpful.\nHow it's done: By planning carefully and communicating well, you can guide changes in a positive direction.\nDetermining that a Change Has Occurred:\n\nWhat it means: Notice when something in the project has changed.\nHow it's done: By keeping a close watch on the project activities and comparing them to the plan, you can spot any changes that happen.\nManaging Actual Changes as They Occur:\n\nWhat it means: Handle the changes when they happen to make sure they don't mess up the project.\nHow it's done: By following a process to evaluate and approve changes, you can manage them effectively and keep the project on track.)/DA( /Helv 9 Tf 0 Tc 10.08 TL 0 0 0 rg )/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Rect[ 254.467 51.9261 699.906 193.924]/Rotate 0/Subtype/FreeText/Type/Annot>>
